    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION ON FRI. 16th OCTOBER @ 12.30PM\r\nhttps://keaneauctioneers.com/online-auctions/\r\n\r\nULTIMATE LOCATION\r\nPresenting a fantastic opportunity to secure a fabulous plot of just over 5 acres in this this much sought after location of ‘Lane of Stones’ in Carne, with magnificent sea views. Positioned on an elevated site, the property enjoys fantastic coastal views and is just 500m from the beach, there are old ruins located on the plot and this would be a fantastic chance of a possible reconstruction. Local beaches completely surround these lands such as\r\nCarnsore point, Nethertown, Carne beach, Ballytrent, St Margarets etc. all within a short distance.  The stunning lakes at Our Lady’s Island & Chour are less than 2km, offering all amenities such as church, café, licensed premises, shop, petrol stationprimary school, adding a community feel and essential amenities right at your doorstep. Surrounded by mature trees, green spaces and an abundance of local wildlife, it provides a peaceful location where everyday begins with birdsong and ends with breathtaking sunsets. The vibrant town of Wexford is just 22km away, offering supermarkets, high-street shopping and nightlife. For those commuting further afield, the N25 and N/M11 are within easy reach and the major transport hub of Rosslare Europort is a mere 9.5km away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Directions\r\nFrom Wexford town proceed on the N25 heading South towards Rosslare, continue along this road and at Ashfield roundabout, take the second exit towards Rosslare Harbour. Travel along this road for approx. 3.5km, just after the village of Tagoat, take the right turn signposted Our Ladys Island. Continue along this road, passing the village of Our Lady’s Island, follow this road, passing the lobster pot on your right continue for a further 2km and then take the left signposted ‘Lane of Stones’. This site is located on the right hand side with a for sale sign."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Apply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072\r\nViewing: Strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent."
      }
    ],
